 op i'm talking about  the full version too  wearing the singer with every passing  chorus bellows a more emphatic and long  jo joe than the last with the final jojo  exclamation lasting  eight seconds that's awesome and for me  it's the series best track  by far and that's my tier list i have a  list of my favorite jojo parts too but  i'll be posting them to my twitter  instead if you want to see that list  check me out at totally not mark while  this definitely won't be the last video  i'll review in the jojo story  it is the last review alright for quite  a while at least until the next act gets  officially translated i think it's such  an amazing thing getting to experience  these stories alongside the fans that  adore it and  for that i am truly grateful and  appreciative for the position that i'm  in and for the support that you've all  given me i'd like to also extend a  special thank you to anime aj for  filling in as a guest editor for this  series  i think he did an amazing job and i  can't wait to work with him in the  future on other projects  however next week it's back to business  as usual for the month of march with  some dragon ball  and maybe some one piece content however  during the month of april  i begin a new series in hunter hunter  i've been waiting to start this story  for ages and i've been hearing  so much about it but until then i've  been toying that mark thank you all once  again so much for the support you've  shown over the last two months and i  can't wait to see you all  on the next adventure  you
 

